                  <a href="/articles/" class="block rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-gray-600 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-900">Articles</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">Partners</div>
                <div class="space-y-1">
                  <a href="/brand-placement-next-edition-847291/" class="block rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-gray-600 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-900">Brand Placement</a>
                  <a href="/nomad_directory/" class="block rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-gray-600 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-900">Nomad Directory</a>
                  <a href="/writers/" class="block rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-gray-600 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-900">For Writers</a>
                  <a href="/distribution-list/" class="block rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-gray-600 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-900">Distribution List</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">Support</div>
                <div class="space-y-1">
                  <a href="/our-story/" class="block rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-gray-600 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-900">Our Story</a>
                  <a href="/support-the-magazine/" class="block rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-gray-600 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-900">Support Magazine</a>
                  <a href="/add-testimonials/" class="block rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-gray-600 transition-colors hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-gray-900">Submit Review</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </aside>

          <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl flex-1">
            <div class="text-center mb-12">
              <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">Fourth Edition Is Here</h1>
              <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 font-medium mb-8">Nomad Magazine — our new edition is out</p>
              <img src="/images/edition-004-cover.webp" alt="Nomad Magazine Edition Four Cover" class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto rounded-xl shadow-lg" />
            </div>

            <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 space-y-8">
              <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                <p>The fourth edition of Nomad Magazine is here — and after two years of growing, it’s the one I’m most proud of.</p>
                <p>In our first three editions we spent a lot of time on the human side of this lifestyle: mindfulness, relationships, loneliness, and the communities that make remote life feel less “remote.” This time, in our fourth edition, we decided to try something new. We went deeper into one of the questions I hear the most: <strong>“Which nomad destinations are growing right now?”</strong></p>
                <p>In this edition we explore places that are gaining real momentum—including Fukuoka, Japan; Bansko, Bulgaria; Madeira, Portugal; and a fresh one for us all: Palermo, Italy. We focused on the kind of insights you only get by being there and talking to people on the ground. We traveled to each destination, interviewed locals, founders, community builders, and nomads, and brought you behind-the-scenes perspectives.</p>
                <p>As always, we publish a mix of topics. This issue includes raising kids on the move, queer nomad viewpoints, travel fashion tips, and a beautiful van-life photo story. One of my personal favorites explains online education possibilities for creative careers—not only through private online courses, but also through a British university offering courses online. We also have a special guest: <strong>Traveling with Kristin</strong> (Kristin Wilson), one of the most well-known digital nomad and travel YouTubers, sharing her perspective after more than thirteen years on the road. For the cover, to feature the spirit of Palermo, we invited the talented illustrators Claudia Brüggen and Molly Maine. We added the <a href="/nomad_directory/" class="text-orange-600 font-semibold hover:text-orange-700 underline">Nomad Directory</a> and coworking space features so you can discover projects and brands that make digital nomad life simpler. And we simplified the design—still us, but more inviting to read. Thank you for being here.</p>
              </div>

              <div class="text-center mb-8">
                <a href="/editions/fourth-edition/" class="inline-block bg-yellow-400 hover:bg-yellow-300 text-gray-900 font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-xl transition-colors">See full edition details →</a>
              </div>

              <section class="border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 bg-white">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-6">What's Inside Edition Four</h2>
                <div class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
                  {[
                    { title: "Why Palermo, Why Now? The Rise Of Italy's No.1 Nomad Capital", page: 10 },
                    { title: "Unlocking Creative Careers: How Falmouth University Empowers Students Through Online Study", page: 26 },
                    { title: "Behind The Brand Of Kristin Wilson: Building A Business Around Freedom", page: 34 },
                    { title: "Van Life: The Beauty, Chaos, And Clarity Of Life On Four Wheels by Cassandra Rae", page: 40 },
                    { title: "Japan: The Art Of Meaningful Encounters In Fukuoka", page: 52 },
                    { title: "The Coworkings Contest: Winners Revealed", page: 66 },
                    { title: "Nomad Directory", page: 82 },
                    { title: "Digital Nomads In Bansko: 5 Years In The Making", page: 90 },
                    { title: "The Nomad Research Lab: On Madeira", page: 98 },
                    { title: "Raising Kids Without Borders By Doris Dario", page: 106 },
                    { title: "Queer Digital Nomads: The Hidden Demographic by Saul O", page: 114 },
                    { title: "Travel Fashion: How To Look Runway-Ready While Traveling", page: 122 },
                  ].map((item) => (
                    <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 py-3">
                      <span class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-snug">{item.title}</span>
                      <span class="shrink-0 text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 tabular-nums">{item.page}</span>
                    </div>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </section>

              <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row">
                  <div class="sm:w-2/5 shrink-0">
                    <img src="/images/edition-004-magazines-on-coffee-table.webp" alt="Nomad Magazine fourth edition print copies on a coffee table in Palermo" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
                  </div>
                  <div class="p-8 flex flex-col justify-center">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
                      <span class="text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">📦</span>
                      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900">Print copies</h2>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">We received our print copies this week and are preparing to ship to our coworking and coliving partners. Individual orders are open until end of February.</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Our focus is distribution — this time we’re not keeping a large leftover stock for individual orders. Order now while it’s available.</p>
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4">
                      <a href="https://pay.nomad-magazine.com/b/fZu14nc2x1bdfAWf0l8bS0L" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block bg-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-7 rounded-xl transition-colors text-sm" aria-label="Order print edition (opens in new tab)">Order print copy →</a>
                      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide font-semibold">Discount code</span>
                        <span class="font-mono font-bold text-sm bg-gray-100 text-gray-900 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 tracking-widest">MINUS5</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 bg-white">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
                  <span class="text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">📱</span>
                  <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900">Digital &amp; mobile version</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-5">Already available on these digital platforms. Pick one:</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-7">
                  <a href="https://www.zinio.com/publications/nomad-magazine/45331" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-gray-300 hover:border-gray-900 text-gray-700 hover:text-gray-900 font-medium text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-colors" aria-label="Zinio (opens in new tab)">Zinio <span class="text-gray-400" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                  <a href="https://www.magazinecafestore.com/products/nomad-magazine-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-gray-300 hover:border-gray-900 text-gray-700 hover:text-gray-900 font-medium text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-colors" aria-label="Magazine Cafe Store (opens in new tab)">Magazine Cafe <span class="text-gray-400" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                  <a href="https://pling.zinioapps.com/publications/nomad-magazine/45331" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-gray-300 hover:border-gray-900 text-gray-700 hover:text-gray-900 font-medium text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-colors" aria-label="Pling (opens in new tab)">Pling <span class="text-gray-400" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                  <a href="https://www.ziniounlimited.com/pt/publications/nomad-magazine/45331" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-gray-300 hover:border-gray-900 text-gray-700 hover:text-gray-900 font-medium text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-colors" aria-label="Zinio Unlimited (opens in new tab)">Zinio Unlimited <span class="text-gray-400" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
