                          <img src={s.logo} alt={s.alt} class="w-full h-full object-contain" style={s.filter ? `filter: ${s.filter}` : undefined} loading="lazy" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1 pr-28">
                          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">{s.name}</h3>
                          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-snug mb-3">{s.description}</p>
                          <a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm font-semibold text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-700 underline" aria-label={`Learn more about ${s.name} (opens in new tab)`}>Learn more →</a>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </section>
            </article>

            <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 text-center mb-5">Monthly supporters of the Nomad Directory</p>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6">
                {supporters.map((s) => (
                  <a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 opacity-50 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity" aria-label={`${s.name} (opens in new tab)`}>
                    <div class="w-14 h-10 flex items-center justify-center">
                      <img src={s.logo} alt={s.alt} class="max-h-10 max-w-[3.5rem] w-auto object-contain grayscale" />
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 font-medium text-center leading-tight max-w-[80px]">{s.name}</span>
                  </a>
                ))}
              </div>
            </section>

            <div class="text-center py-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
              <a href="/editions/fourth-edition/" class="inline-block bg-yellow-400 hover:bg-yellow-300 text-gray-900 font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-xl transition-colors">See full edition details →</a>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide font-semibold">Print discount</span>
                <span class="font-mono font-bold text-sm bg-gray-100 text-gray-900 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 tracking-widest">MINUS5</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 border-t border-gray-100 pt-10">
              <h2 class="text-sm font-black text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Why we make this magazine</h2>
              <div class="max-w-none text-gray-400 text-xs leading-relaxed space-y-3">
                <p>Nomad Magazine is a print and digital publication about digital nomad life, created in 2024, as an alternative to the AI + SEO noise dominating the internet. Every piece we publish is written by real people, edited by two high-end editors, and designed page by page and carefully curated by me. We publish articles you can sit with like a book, without interruptions.</p>
                <p>We love print. Although, creating a physical edition is an exciting but genuinely painful process, and that's exactly why it is valuable. And we offer a digital version through our mobile distribution partners for those who prefer to read on mobile.</p>
                <p>We love digital nomad life and supporting its future because it gives people a real choice about how they live: improving quality of life, offering more opportunities, building international experience, and connecting communities that wouldn't otherwise exist. At the same time we support the projects and brands that work with passion, to make that life easier.</p>
                <p>And we genuinely believe Nomad Magazine is a unique, standout project, and we put our heart into it. For us, it's not only a magazine (or a digital platform) that connects people, it's also a project that supports local communities and helps us grow into a better global society.</p>
                <p class="mt-4 text-gray-500 font-medium">— Lera, Founder & CEO of Nomad Magazine</p>
              </div>
            </section>
          </main>
        </div>
